sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Noema REPL Client (Python)
    participant REPL as Lean 4 REPL Subprocess (lake env)
    participant Lean as Lean 4 Elaborator & Kernel
    participant Indep as Fresh Process Checker

    Note over Client, REPL: Session Initialization
    Client->>REPL: Spawn subprocess with NDJSON pipe
    REPL-->>Client: Handshake & readiness confirmation

    Note over Client, Lean: Tactic Step Execution
    Client->>REPL: {"cmd": "run_tactic", "env": env_id, "tactic": "intro h"}
    REPL->>Lean: Elaborate tactic on open goals
    Lean-->>REPL: New goal state & diagnostic messages
    REPL-->>Client: {"status": "ok", "goals": ["h : P |- Q"], "env": env_id_next}

    Note over Client, REPL: Proof Completed
    Client->>REPL: {"cmd": "run_tactic", "env": env_id_next, "tactic": "exact h"}
    REPL->>Lean: Kernel typecheck proof term
    Lean-->>REPL: No remaining goals (Proof Closed)
    REPL-->>Client: {"status": "ok", "goals": [], "closed": true}

    Note over Client, Indep: Independent Certificate Audit
    Client->>Indep: Spawn fresh isolated `lake env lean` process
    Indep->>Indep: Re-elaborate proof script from scratch
    Indep-->>Client: Exit code 0 (Verified Without State Contamination)
